{
  "name": "Sanaku - W3 Demo Booking",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## W3 - Demo booking (Google Calendar, not Calendly)\n\nFour entry points:\n1. **GET /webhook/sanaku-slots** - the Netlify booking page calls this to render open slots (weekdays 10:00-16:00 PT, 30-min, next 10 business days, minus GCal busy blocks, nothing inside 24h)\n2. **POST /webhook/sanaku-book** - creates the GCal event (both attendees), writes `sanaku_demos` with the firm/city/notes from the form, flips the prospect to `demo_booked` if the email matches one, texts me via RingCentral + emails me\n3. **Hourly** - 24h and 1h email reminders to the prospect\n4. **Daily 08:00** - no-shows get a follow-up email next morning and `outcome = 'no_show'`\n\nCredentials: \"Google Calendar account\" (OAuth2, used by the HTTP nodes as predefined credential), \"Supabase Service Role (Header Auth)\", \"RingCentral (Header Auth)\" (Authorization: Bearer <token>), \"Gmail Account\".\nEnv: SUPABASE_URL, SANAKU_OWNER_EMAIL, MY_CELL_NUMBER, RC_SMS_FROM, SANAKU_BOOKING_URL.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 580
      },
      "id": "f4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000099",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "GET",
